# Two people meet in #general; the bots answer in #bots.
alice: NICK alice
bob: NICK bob
alice: JOIN #general
bob: JOIN #general
alice: MSG #general hello bob
bob: MSG #general hi alice
alice: WHO #general
bob: JOIN #bots
bob: MSG #bots !echo is anyone there
bob: !read
bob: MSG #bots !stats
bob: !read
alice: ROOMS
alice: HISTORY #general 5
bob: PART #general
alice: WHOAMI
alice: PING done
